      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan subseksyen (3b) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: “(3b) A claim for damages for bereavement shall only be for the benefit of— (a) the spouse of the person deceased; (b) the child of the person deceased; and (c) the parents of the person deceased.”;"
